# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# finance-career-hub .gitignore
# Rule of thumb: secrets, personal data and generated files never
# get committed. If in doubt, add it here BEFORE running git add.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Secrets / environment ---
# Real keys live in .env.local (or .env). Only the placeholder
# template .env.example is tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# --- Your personal data (notes, applications, flashcard progress) ---
# The app writes JSON files here. Keep the folder, ignore the contents.
/data/*
!/data/.gitkeep

# --- API response cache ---
/.cache/

# --- Local databases (in case one is ever added) ---
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# --- Dependencies ---
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# --- Build output ---
/.next/
/out/
/build
/dist
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# --- Testing ---
/coverage

# --- Logs ---
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
*.log

# --- Deployment tooling ---
.vercel

# --- OS junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- Editors ---
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
